    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 21</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man folciscne mæssepreost mid tihtlan belecge þe regollif næbbe, ladige hine swa swa diacon þe regollife libbe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If an accusation is brought against a secular priest who does not live according to a rule, he shall clear himself in the same way as a deacon who lives according to a rule.</ab>
      </div>
